      "description": "The dashboard and its summary-cards subcomponent register elements with the UI Bridge SDK so that currentRouteOnly=true snapshots return the page's interactive content (refresh button, time-range selector, metric cards, charts, task-run table), not just sidebar chrome. Exposes stable element ids that automation workflows can target without depending on rendered text. A `page:llm-analytics` component and a `llm-analytics-root` element are always present; the metric-card and chart registrations require the corresponding data branch to have rendered.",
